🔌 API
Analyze Message

Endpoint

POST /analyze
Request
{
  "message": "Your account will be blocked. Verify your OTP immediately."
}
Response
{
  "score": 84,
  "risk_level": "HIGH RISK",
  "detected": []
}

The application may also return URL intelligence and AI security analysis depending on the message and configured services.

🛡️ Security Considerations

ScamShield is designed as a risk-assessment tool, not a definitive malware or fraud detector.

A message being classified as safe does not guarantee that it is legitimate.

Users should always:

Avoid sharing OTPs or passwords
Verify requests through official channels
Avoid clicking unexpected links
Check the sender carefully
Never send money based solely on an unsolicited message
⚠️ Limitations

Current detection is based on a combination of predefined patterns, URL heuristics, and AI analysis.

Possible limitations include:

False positives
False negatives
Newly emerging scam patterns
Context-dependent messages
AI-generated analysis variability

ScamShield should therefore be used as an additional security layer rather than a replacement for professional cybersecurity tools.

